    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Us On Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Playtest Info</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join <strong>Midair 2</strong> playtest now by clicking &quot;Request Access&quot; above and get ready to fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Info </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Midair 2</strong> brings a new dimension to shooters with its high-speed aerial combat using advanced movement and physics to outmaneuver your opponents from every angle. Discover a new way to experience shooters! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">True Freedom</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the art of movement in <strong>Midair 2</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With frictionless boots and a powerful jetpack, perform high-speed airborne assaults, dodge enemy fire with precision, and traverse the map effortlessly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your jetpack draws from your armor\u2019s energy pool, so strategic management of your energy is crucial for maintaining a combat advantage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you need a vertical boost or enhanced maneuverability, adapt your jetpack usage to the situation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experienced players instinctively balance their jetpack and energy for maximum efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1231210/extras/4b3cc473bb3d31f27ef864aae4fe6ab6.poster.avif?t=1748451520\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1231210/extras/4b3cc473bb3d31f27ef864aae4fe6ab6.webm?t=1748451520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Teamwork is Critical</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coordination is key in <strong>Midair 2</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Formulate strategic assaults to dismantle enemy defenses and secure their flag while defending your own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team synergy is vital as enemies adept at the terrain and movement will swiftly infiltrate, seize your flag, and escape. With a reliable team, you can dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for an unparalleled shooter experience with <strong>Midair 2</strong>. Suit up, power up your jets, and soar to new heights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1231210/extras/d321adb77ed39faef21afa91aed881f3.poster.avif?t=1748451520\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1231210/extras/d321adb77ed39faef21afa91aed881f3.webp?t=1748451520\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join us in <strong>Midair 2</strong> for an exhilarating adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We'll see you in the skies!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Playtest Info</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join <strong>Midair 2</strong> playtest now by clicking &quot;Request Access&quot; above and get ready to fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Info </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Midair 2</strong> brings a new dimension to shooters with its high-speed aerial combat using advanced movement and physics to outmaneuver your opponents from every angle. Discover a new way to experience shooters! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">True Freedom</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the art of movement in <strong>Midair 2</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With frictionless boots and a powerful jetpack, perform high-speed airborne assaults, dodge enemy fire with precision, and traverse the map effortlessly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your jetpack draws from your armor\u2019s energy pool, so strategic management of your energy is crucial for maintaining a combat advantage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you need a vertical boost or enhanced maneuverability, adapt your jetpack usage to the situation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experienced players instinctively balance their jetpack and energy for maximum efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1231210/extras/4b3cc473bb3d31f27ef864aae4fe6ab6.poster.avif?t=1748451520\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1231210/extras/4b3cc473bb3d31f27ef864aae4fe6ab6.webm?t=1748451520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Teamwork is Critical</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coordination is key in <strong>Midair 2</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Formulate strategic assaults to dismantle enemy defenses and secure their flag while defending your own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team synergy is vital as enemies adept at the terrain and movement will swiftly infiltrate, seize your flag, and escape. With a reliable team, you can dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for an unparalleled shooter experience with <strong>Midair 2</strong>. Suit up, power up your jets, and soar to new heights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1231210/extras/d321adb77ed39faef21afa91aed881f3.poster.avif?t=1748451520\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1231210/extras/d321adb77ed39faef21afa91aed881f3.webp?t=1748451520\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join us in <strong>Midair 2</strong> for an exhilarating adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We'll see you in the skies!</p>",
